WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:01.000
MkvDrama.net

01:29.700 --> 01:31.620
[Blood River]

01:31.620 --> 01:33.980
[Based on the novel of the same name from Zhou Munan's Youth in Jianghu series]

01:33.980 --> 01:35.980
[Available on fanqienovel.com & bkneng.com]

01:36.340 --> 01:39.020
[Episode 16]

01:47.280 --> 01:47.850
Oh no.

01:48.560 --> 01:49.570
It seems we're going to die here.

01:50.870 --> 01:51.290
Look.

01:51.680 --> 01:52.620
The sky is getting dark,

01:53.200 --> 01:54.740
yet we still haven't managed to break through the gate.

01:56.350 --> 01:56.900
Just give up.

01:57.310 --> 01:58.980
Back then, they even managed to impede

01:59.150 --> 02:00.130
Baili Dongjun and Ye Dingzhi.

02:00.840 --> 02:02.050
Not to mention you two.

02:09.000 --> 02:09.730
The Dipper Array,

02:10.310 --> 02:11.220
one shall vanquish it.

02:17.310 --> 02:18.170
The array will be vanquished soon.

02:20.240 --> 02:21.340
Su Muyu?

02:28.360 --> 02:29.610
So, you neutralized the Drunken Dream Bone

02:30.280 --> 02:30.980
on yourself, huh?

02:34.630 --> 02:36.730
You truly bring unexpected surprises.

02:41.430 --> 02:42.570
The battle has already begun.

02:43.030 --> 02:44.010
Our swords are already unsheathed.

02:44.470 --> 02:45.610
There's no need to care too much.

02:47.400 --> 02:47.890
You have a point.

02:49.190 --> 02:50.340
Go and do what you're supposed to do.

02:50.960 --> 02:51.500
As for them,

02:52.120 --> 02:53.220
we'll stall them for you.

02:57.310 --> 02:57.890
Thank you.

02:58.870 --> 03:00.170
It's my honor

03:00.960 --> 03:01.820
to witness such changes.

03:02.630 --> 03:03.260
Me too.

03:09.910 --> 03:11.130
The direction he's heading in,

03:12.310 --> 03:12.940
is it the Wanjuan Tower.

03:15.240 --> 03:16.780
So, you guys lay dormant all this time

03:16.840 --> 03:17.820
because you were after this, huh?

03:19.780 --> 03:26.140
[Forbidden Ground, No Entry]

03:52.190 --> 03:53.170
According to my plan,

03:53.840 --> 03:54.660
I suppose most of the Shadow Sect's forces

03:54.680 --> 03:56.010
have been transferred elsewhere,

03:56.190 --> 03:57.170
including Wanjuan Tower.

03:57.870 --> 03:59.340
But it seems the Shadow Sect's foundations

03:59.840 --> 04:01.610
run deeper than we imagined.

04:04.150 --> 04:05.220
You're pretty good.

04:13.080 --> 04:14.540
It seems Master Su

04:14.590 --> 04:15.570
has already started the fight.

04:16.000 --> 04:16.410
Changhe,

04:16.830 --> 04:17.930
is our current goal

04:18.000 --> 04:19.160
to annihilate the Shadow Sect?

04:19.390 --> 04:21.290
What has the Shadow Sect got to do with us?

04:21.680 --> 04:22.660
That's the duty of Tianqi City.

04:23.390 --> 04:24.460
Our current goal

04:25.240 --> 04:26.140
is that building.

04:26.480 --> 04:27.250
That building?

04:28.270 --> 04:29.170
What's so special about it?

04:29.360 --> 04:30.250
The Wanjuan Tower

04:30.750 --> 04:31.580
houses the information

04:31.630 --> 04:32.730
of all members in Blood River.

04:33.360 --> 04:34.700
Rumor has it that every detail was recorded

04:35.000 --> 04:35.700
since birth.

04:36.120 --> 04:37.170
Doesn't that mean...

04:39.430 --> 04:40.900
We'll know once we enter the tower.

04:43.800 --> 04:44.340
Mu Ciling!

04:52.040 --> 04:53.700
I shall open a path for you, my lord.

04:56.510 --> 04:56.850
Master.

04:57.830 --> 04:58.580
Blood River

04:58.630 --> 04:59.460
has invaded our sect under the lead

04:59.510 --> 05:00.100
of a bladesman clad in red.

05:01.800 --> 05:02.140
Master,

05:02.600 --> 05:03.900
Wanjuan Tower has sent out a signal arrow.

05:04.190 --> 05:05.290
I think someone has invaded the premises.

05:08.390 --> 05:08.780
Master,

05:09.120 --> 05:10.730
Water Official brought an expert impersonator with him

05:11.190 --> 05:12.730
and broke into our prison under your guise.

05:13.310 --> 05:14.050
Right now, Su Muyu

05:14.830 --> 05:15.810
has exited the Shadow Prison.

05:16.190 --> 05:16.980
They attacked

05:17.040 --> 05:17.930
Prince of Langya

05:18.310 --> 05:19.220
and Imperial Father-in-Law's Residence at the same time.

05:19.480 --> 05:20.580
What is their goal?

05:21.270 --> 05:21.980
I'm afraid

05:23.000 --> 05:25.220
the attack on Fengxiao Temple is just a feint.

05:26.040 --> 05:27.900
Their encirclement of Shadow Sect

05:28.600 --> 05:31.220
seems to be a long-coming plot of theirs.

05:32.430 --> 05:34.220
They pretended to attack Xiao Ruofeng

05:34.630 --> 05:36.340
while borrowing a large number of our forces,

05:37.000 --> 05:39.100
causing the security here to be lax.

05:40.870 --> 05:43.220
What an elaborate plot.

05:46.480 --> 05:47.850
It's a shame that they forgot something.

05:48.600 --> 05:50.170
How could I rule over the Shadow Sect

05:50.390 --> 05:52.100
all these years if I didn't have

05:52.160 --> 05:52.980
a trick or two up my sleeves?

05:53.870 --> 05:55.370
Within Wanjuan Tower,

05:56.560 --> 05:57.610
I've left them

05:57.680 --> 05:58.850
with a huge gift!

05:59.430 --> 06:00.900
Why do they care about Wanjuan Tower so much?

06:01.480 --> 06:03.170
What they truly fear

06:04.510 --> 06:06.250
isn't the power of Shadow Sect.

06:06.950 --> 06:08.780
It's the fact that the Shadow Sect

06:08.830 --> 06:10.020
keeps all of Blood River's secrets.

06:10.680 --> 06:11.540
As long as they destroy

06:11.600 --> 06:12.340
all of the hidden documents

06:12.360 --> 06:13.780
in Wanjuan Tower,

06:14.240 --> 06:14.810
they can

06:14.870 --> 06:16.780
hide their tracks entirely.

06:18.190 --> 06:19.250
By then, they can establish

06:20.120 --> 06:22.100
a new Blood River.

06:23.630 --> 06:24.610
This time,

06:29.430 --> 06:32.900
I've truly lost the bet.

06:34.480 --> 06:35.490
What a shame,

06:36.190 --> 06:37.340
Su Muyu.

06:38.480 --> 06:40.220
You'll never be able to discover the secret

06:41.190 --> 06:43.540
behind No-Sword City's annihilation.

06:43.720 --> 06:44.540
You bet on the fact

06:44.920 --> 06:45.810
that they would yield to the coercion

06:45.870 --> 06:47.100
due to their desire for freedom.

06:47.480 --> 06:48.930
But you don't understand them at all.

06:49.190 --> 06:50.410
They were able to get this far

06:50.600 --> 06:52.220
because they didn't fear any coercion.

06:52.310 --> 06:53.930
Each step they took was getting them closer to freedom.

06:54.800 --> 06:55.930
I already gave you a reminder,

06:56.480 --> 06:57.290
Master Yi.

06:58.630 --> 07:00.290
Keep the swords away.

07:02.070 --> 07:03.100
Compared to them,

07:04.120 --> 07:04.930
you do seem

07:05.000 --> 07:06.340
like a better trading partner.

07:09.310 --> 07:10.050
It's a shame

07:10.750 --> 07:11.810
that they have

07:12.120 --> 07:13.490
the Dormant Dragon Sword.

07:14.920 --> 07:16.170
I already advised you long ago

07:16.950 --> 07:17.980
that you should've killed Su Muyu

07:18.040 --> 07:18.980
when he first came

07:19.720 --> 07:20.780
to your residence.

07:21.190 --> 07:22.340
According to what you said,

07:22.600 --> 07:24.100
you should've killed them

07:24.190 --> 07:25.370
during the naming ceremony.

07:25.480 --> 07:26.980
If so, none of this would've happened!

07:27.240 --> 07:28.610
Former head of the Mu family,

07:29.680 --> 07:30.780
Mu Zizhe?

07:32.950 --> 07:33.580
Today,

07:34.390 --> 07:35.540
I shall complete

07:35.600 --> 07:37.140
what I couldn't back then.

07:37.950 --> 07:39.170
I will kill Su Changhe,

07:39.920 --> 07:41.020
and retrieve the Dormant Dragon Sword.

07:41.800 --> 07:43.220
I shall rule over Blood River.

07:44.120 --> 07:45.290
By then, I will make a deal with you,

07:46.360 --> 07:47.580
Master Yi.

07:53.100 --> 07:54.980
[Wanjuan Tower]

07:55.630 --> 07:56.700
Tell me your name.

07:57.830 --> 07:58.900
Su Muyu of Blood River.

08:00.000 --> 08:00.780
What about your name?

08:01.480 --> 08:01.980
I'm Xie Zaiye

08:02.430 --> 08:03.290
[Xie Zaiye, Shadow Sect]
of Shadow Sect.

08:04.120 --> 08:05.140
I've heard of you before.

08:05.950 --> 08:06.900
You're the Umbrella Ghost.

08:08.540 --> 08:10.460
[Imperial Astronomical Bureau]

08:25.040 --> 08:26.580
Master.

08:29.750 --> 08:31.490
It seems I've been asleep for a long time.

08:45.200 --> 08:46.180
Master.

08:46.510 --> 08:47.580
Where are you going?

08:49.550 --> 08:51.060
To visit an old acquaintance.

08:53.480 --> 08:54.300
Master is as

08:54.480 --> 08:55.530
unpredictably profound as always.

08:55.530 --> 08:56.300
[Imperial Astronomical Bureau]

08:56.300 --> 09:01.820
[Qi Mausoleum]

09:18.030 --> 09:19.610
Chancellor, to think that you are here.

09:23.150 --> 09:24.940
This place is guarded by the Imperial Guards.

09:25.630 --> 09:27.420
The Five Great Eunuchs of the previous dynasty

09:27.440 --> 09:28.700
stood guard here.

09:29.030 --> 09:30.250
When ordinary folk see them coming,

09:30.670 --> 09:31.580
they turn aside and make way

09:31.600 --> 09:33.730
even from three li away.

09:34.960 --> 09:36.130
What are you doing here?

09:40.790 --> 09:42.530
I had a dream last night.

09:42.910 --> 09:44.490
I dreamt about you, Sir Zhuo Qing.

09:45.360 --> 09:47.530
Thus, I came here on a whim

09:47.550 --> 09:48.730
in order to find you.

09:49.240 --> 09:51.610
I wish to play a round of weiqi with you.

09:52.670 --> 09:54.940
Ever since the Eunuch Rebellion

09:55.480 --> 09:57.940
that happened a few dynasties ago,

09:58.390 --> 09:59.980
to prevent that tragedy from

10:00.000 --> 10:01.100
happening again,

10:01.670 --> 10:02.890
in the generations that followed,

10:03.000 --> 10:03.980
after each emperor's passing,

10:04.390 --> 10:06.650
the Five Great Eunuchs who served him

10:07.000 --> 10:07.700
would be sent here

10:07.910 --> 10:09.700
to keep guard over the Imperial Mausoleum.

10:10.150 --> 10:11.250
Thus,

10:11.550 --> 10:12.770
I have no choice but to come here

10:12.840 --> 10:14.130
and seek you out.

10:15.840 --> 10:16.370
At least

10:16.600 --> 10:19.300
that's what it seems like to outsiders.

10:31.670 --> 10:32.530
Chancellor,

10:34.320 --> 10:36.130
you really do know how to pick your timing, huh?

10:37.550 --> 10:39.820
That's not the only thing I know.

10:40.440 --> 10:42.610
I know how to buy time as well.

10:44.390 --> 10:45.980
Chancellor, what a shame.

10:46.790 --> 10:47.530
I suppose

10:48.720 --> 10:50.650
I'm not in the mood tonight.

10:56.480 --> 10:57.850
According to the rules set by our ancestors,

10:58.240 --> 10:59.250
the eunuchs guarding the Imperial Mausoleum

10:59.390 --> 11:01.250
are not to leave the premises.

11:02.120 --> 11:05.370
And now, you're taking one more step away.

11:05.910 --> 11:06.820
I haven't included

11:07.200 --> 11:08.730
the number of steps you've taken previously as well.

11:08.750 --> 11:09.490
Chancellor,

11:10.630 --> 11:11.730
you see,

11:12.790 --> 11:15.100
certain things are meaningless if you make them too obvious.

11:18.080 --> 11:18.650
Indeed.

11:19.480 --> 11:21.700
Certain things are meaningless

11:22.030 --> 11:23.460
if we make them too obvious.

11:30.150 --> 11:31.340
Chancellor, it seems

11:32.120 --> 11:34.180
you're bent on stopping me today.

11:36.550 --> 11:37.580
Not necessarily.

11:42.870 --> 11:44.460
I just want to play a round of weiqi with you.

11:45.960 --> 11:47.650
If we do engage each other in battle,

11:48.870 --> 11:50.180
I suppose the entire Tianqi City

11:50.270 --> 11:51.650
will tremble.

11:55.550 --> 11:56.940
Ever since the great battle atop the Imperial City

11:57.600 --> 12:00.530
between Baili Dongjun and Ye Dingzhi,

12:01.480 --> 12:02.460
Tianqi City

12:02.960 --> 12:04.610
has never welcomed such a spectacle again.

12:05.510 --> 12:06.370
Let me put it this way.

12:06.960 --> 12:08.700
Some of the spectacles happened deep at night.

12:08.870 --> 12:10.220
They ended before dawn.

12:10.630 --> 12:12.340
Many people couldn't witness them.

12:37.120 --> 12:38.250
If, back then,

12:38.750 --> 12:39.730
Mr. Li didn't inflict

12:39.790 --> 12:41.100
a blow to my head,

12:41.910 --> 12:42.580
I suppose

12:42.910 --> 12:44.250
I would've engaged you in combat

12:44.440 --> 12:45.530
today.

12:49.440 --> 12:50.420
I wonder

12:50.960 --> 12:52.940
if Mr. Li was a prophet

12:53.960 --> 12:56.010
or he just wanted to bully me.

12:57.510 --> 12:58.340
Stop overthinking it.

12:58.720 --> 13:00.180
He merely wanted to bully you.

13:00.750 --> 13:02.130
It's better for you

13:02.790 --> 13:03.890
to play weiqi with me.

14:30.000 --> 14:31.130
You stopped my arrow.

14:31.720 --> 14:32.490
Good job.

14:33.510 --> 14:34.490
I can tell.

14:34.720 --> 14:35.970
It's either that you were injured

14:36.030 --> 14:37.010
or you just recovered from a serious illness.

14:37.550 --> 14:38.730
Your zhenqi is very unstable.

14:40.720 --> 14:42.370
But I'm sure you can't stop

14:43.120 --> 14:44.220
my next technique, Seven Stars.

14:51.240 --> 14:52.730
Seven Stars?

14:59.390 --> 15:00.850
This is a bow technique passed down by my ancestors.

15:01.630 --> 15:03.340
This technique had killed five warlords born of chaos.

15:03.960 --> 15:05.610
You should feel honored that I'm using it

15:06.200 --> 15:07.180
on an assassin like you.

15:17.360 --> 15:18.220
The power of this arrow

15:18.750 --> 15:19.490
is actually almost twice

15:19.510 --> 15:20.700
the last arrow.

15:22.750 --> 15:23.770
For Seven Stars,

15:23.910 --> 15:25.180
each arrow is stronger than the last.

15:25.870 --> 15:26.890
If you try to block another arrow,

15:27.600 --> 15:29.340
your sword will surely break.

16:06.000 --> 16:06.650
What is...

16:11.550 --> 16:12.460
Is that Sword of Taiji?

16:14.840 --> 16:16.340
An assassin like you actually knows how to use

16:16.360 --> 16:17.490
the slowest sword art in the world, huh?

16:18.000 --> 16:19.010
However, the next arrow

16:19.270 --> 16:20.130
won't be as simple.

16:20.750 --> 16:21.300
Is that so?

16:21.870 --> 16:22.580
But it's also obvious that your technique

16:22.670 --> 16:24.300
is consuming a lot of your stamina.

16:25.550 --> 16:26.340
Please fire

16:27.550 --> 16:28.250
your next arrow.

16:41.440 --> 16:42.560
I'll leave this place to you guys.

16:43.030 --> 16:44.650
I'll go and check on the head of the Su family.

16:45.790 --> 16:46.340
All right!

16:50.910 --> 16:53.220
So, this is the so-called Shadow Sect, huh?

16:53.480 --> 16:56.180
You guys think that you can control Blood River when you're this weak?

16:56.840 --> 16:57.940
Fools.

17:34.000 --> 17:34.980
This is an artifact of Mu family,

17:35.480 --> 17:36.290
the Celestial Ninefold Zither.

17:37.200 --> 17:37.660
I couldn't find it

17:38.350 --> 17:39.900
when I searched our sect.

17:40.480 --> 17:40.940
It turns out

17:41.350 --> 17:42.700
that he was bringing it with him everywhere he went.

17:47.030 --> 17:48.420
So, you're still alive.

17:51.030 --> 17:52.180
You traitor.

17:52.920 --> 17:54.050
As a member of the Mu family,

17:54.680 --> 17:56.010
how dare you serve the Su family?

17:59.790 --> 18:00.730
You idiot.

18:04.720 --> 18:06.380
Blood River's rule has already shifted,

18:06.440 --> 18:08.010
yet you're still talking about the Three Families?

18:09.550 --> 18:11.570
The tide has already cast you away.

18:17.920 --> 18:18.940
Time to die.

18:21.070 --> 18:23.730
Together with the old Blood River.

18:54.200 --> 18:55.490
I have one last arrow.

18:56.270 --> 18:56.810
And you

18:57.510 --> 18:58.420
will die for sure!

19:51.240 --> 19:51.620
Grandfather.

19:52.030 --> 19:52.660
Uncles.

19:58.590 --> 19:59.090
You're finally here.

20:01.030 --> 20:02.180
Are you reprimanding me for being late?

20:03.110 --> 20:03.900
So, you two are

20:04.480 --> 20:06.630
the current leaders of Blood River, huh?

20:08.750 --> 20:10.380
You two do look very young.

20:11.750 --> 20:13.730
I'm Su Changhe, the Patriarch of Blood River.

20:14.160 --> 20:15.460
Greetings, elders.

20:16.680 --> 20:17.980
The person next to me is Su Muyu.

20:18.400 --> 20:19.900
He's the current head of the Su family.

20:20.750 --> 20:22.660
Elders, may I know your names?

20:23.060 --> 20:24.590
[Xie Biyou, Shadow Sect]

20:24.590 --> 20:25.860
Xie Biyou.

20:26.500 --> 20:27.240
[Mu Fusheng, Shadow Sect]

20:27.240 --> 20:28.330
Mu Fusheng.

20:29.270 --> 20:30.460
[Su Ziyan, Shadow Sect]
Su Ziyan.

20:31.480 --> 20:32.570
So, your surnames are Xie,

20:33.000 --> 20:33.330
Mu,

20:33.720 --> 20:34.180
and Su?

20:34.750 --> 20:36.220
Those are the surnames of Blood River's Three Families.

20:37.240 --> 20:38.010
Who are you guys?

20:41.400 --> 20:42.980
They're quite surprised upon hearing

20:43.550 --> 20:45.010
our surnames.

20:46.830 --> 20:47.330
Indeed.

20:48.030 --> 20:49.700
We and the Three Families of Blood River

20:50.480 --> 20:52.010
come from the same branch.

20:53.000 --> 20:53.530
Back then,

20:54.440 --> 20:55.220
some of our ancestors

20:55.830 --> 20:57.700
joined the martial world

20:58.240 --> 21:00.420
while some of them remained here.

21:01.200 --> 21:02.290
The three of us

21:02.720 --> 21:04.860
are the descendants of those

21:04.960 --> 21:06.730
who remained in Tianqi City.

21:08.270 --> 21:09.860
That only includes your ancestors.

21:10.200 --> 21:11.530
It doesn't include us.

21:15.830 --> 21:17.860
Chang He and I were born Nameless.

21:18.790 --> 21:20.860
We bear no lineage of the Three Families.

21:21.480 --> 21:22.700
So, the Three Families of Blood River

21:23.270 --> 21:24.130
have already been

21:24.130 --> 21:25.650
taken over by outsiders like you all.

21:26.680 --> 21:28.420
No wonder you would invade our premises

21:28.680 --> 21:30.420
and go against the Shadow Sect!

21:32.240 --> 21:33.700
When the old fades, the new ascends.

21:34.400 --> 21:36.810
That's the rule of the world.

21:38.880 --> 21:39.770
Young men,

21:40.960 --> 21:42.420
did you two come here

21:43.550 --> 21:45.460
to infiltrate Wanjuan Tower?

21:46.350 --> 21:46.770
Indeed.

21:48.160 --> 21:49.090
However, there are

21:49.960 --> 21:51.180
no treasures or martial arts manuals

21:51.750 --> 21:53.010
within Wanjuan Tower.

21:53.550 --> 21:54.620
It only harbors the secrets

21:54.680 --> 21:56.330
of the world.

21:57.070 --> 21:58.050
What exactly

21:59.070 --> 22:00.180
is your goal here?

22:01.480 --> 22:03.090
Since it harbors the secrets of the world,

22:03.790 --> 22:05.570
naturally, it also harbors the secrets of Blood River.

22:06.790 --> 22:07.420
Are you guys

22:08.030 --> 22:09.810
trying to destroy Wanjuan Tower?

22:10.270 --> 22:11.220
So what if we are?

22:15.200 --> 22:16.900
Not only are we going to destroy Wanjuan Tower,

22:17.920 --> 22:18.940
but we're also going

22:19.000 --> 22:19.700
to sever the ties

22:19.720 --> 22:21.220
between Blood River and Shadow Sect.

22:23.590 --> 22:24.250
It seems

22:24.830 --> 22:25.900
the wish of our pioneers

22:26.590 --> 22:28.010
during the founding of our nation,

22:28.070 --> 22:30.010
which was to protect the nation with its shadow,

22:31.350 --> 22:32.900
has fallen apart.

22:33.240 --> 22:34.420
It fell apart long ago.

22:35.110 --> 22:36.660
Blood River and Shadow Sect stopped being

22:36.720 --> 22:37.980
the shadow that protected the world long ago.

22:38.640 --> 22:39.330
Now, we're the pawns

22:39.400 --> 22:40.730
of those who fight for power

22:41.400 --> 22:43.090
in broad daylight.

22:44.030 --> 22:45.490
Do you think Nameless individuals like you two

22:46.270 --> 22:47.980
can sever the ties of the two organizations?

22:48.640 --> 22:49.700
I alone am enough.

22:57.680 --> 22:58.620
Eighteen-Sword Array?

23:01.720 --> 23:03.620
Let me exchange some blows with you, then.

23:04.440 --> 23:05.380
My pleasure.

23:36.240 --> 23:36.660
Uncle Zhe,

23:37.000 --> 23:38.050
all of Shadow Sect's members have retreated.

23:41.200 --> 23:42.860
I suppose they found out

23:42.960 --> 23:44.040
that we had destroyed their den.

23:46.790 --> 23:48.010
Since that's the case,

23:48.070 --> 23:49.580
there's no point in keeping up the act.

23:50.720 --> 23:52.140
Your Highness, your Realm-Rending Sword Art

23:52.350 --> 23:53.430
is amazing indeed.

23:54.880 --> 23:56.930
Mr. Su Zhe, your Heaven-Demon Sixteen Dances

23:56.960 --> 23:57.700
is ferocious as well.

23:58.440 --> 23:59.620
It's been so many years

24:00.070 --> 24:01.420
since I last enjoyed a fight.

24:02.640 --> 24:04.380
If so, we shall put a stop to our act.

24:05.200 --> 24:06.940
But the final result of this conflict

24:07.400 --> 24:08.770
will still depend on the two brothers

24:08.790 --> 24:09.730
in Tianqi City.

24:14.510 --> 24:15.050
Your Highness,

24:15.640 --> 24:16.490
do you want a puff?

24:17.960 --> 24:19.100
Mr. Su, you're too courteous.

24:21.200 --> 24:21.770
If so,

24:23.550 --> 24:24.620
why don't you have some preserved plums?

24:28.750 --> 24:29.420
There's nothing left.

24:29.880 --> 24:32.000
Your blow had crushed all of them.

24:33.310 --> 24:33.980
What a shame.

24:37.750 --> 24:40.270
Mr. Su, you're interesting indeed.

24:41.070 --> 24:42.890
Preserved plums and a pipe,

24:43.160 --> 24:44.860
lying on the ground with all fours, good night.

24:46.510 --> 24:47.420
Abbot, you're wrong.

24:48.070 --> 24:49.700
It should be "running with all fours, full of might."

24:52.400 --> 24:54.220
Amitabha.

25:52.830 --> 25:53.860
Even if you were to stop

25:53.880 --> 25:55.530
the sharpest Puppet Razor Strings,

25:56.110 --> 25:56.940
the only bladeless weapon

25:56.960 --> 25:58.250
in the world,

25:58.680 --> 25:59.530
you'll be ripped to shreds

25:59.590 --> 26:01.810
the moment you block it.

26:11.590 --> 26:13.090
You might still stand a chance to survive

26:13.640 --> 26:15.010
if you use Hell Palm now.

26:18.790 --> 26:20.570
The Hell Palm is unnecessary

26:20.590 --> 26:22.530
to deal with an eccentric person like you

26:23.440 --> 26:24.530
who doesn't even dare to face me head-on.

26:28.510 --> 26:29.490
Back then, in our generation,

26:29.960 --> 26:31.140
the Mu family

26:31.750 --> 26:33.050
had the highest chance to rise to the top

26:33.550 --> 26:35.010
because of you and me.

26:36.160 --> 26:37.140
It's all your fault.

26:37.720 --> 26:38.810
You didn't heed Master's words

26:38.880 --> 26:39.660
and merely did what you liked.

26:40.550 --> 26:41.940
It caused the Mu family

26:42.680 --> 26:43.980
to be the weakest family

26:44.070 --> 26:45.810
among the Three Families.

26:47.640 --> 26:48.420
I...

26:49.640 --> 26:51.770
I only live for my own sake!

26:53.400 --> 26:54.490
If other people attack me,

26:55.790 --> 26:57.180
I'll return the favor.

26:57.960 --> 26:59.330
If other people want to kill me,

27:00.160 --> 27:00.940
I'll kill them

27:00.960 --> 27:02.220
before they can kill me!

27:07.200 --> 27:08.250
If they want to make me bow

27:08.310 --> 27:09.570
and succumb,

27:12.720 --> 27:16.620
I will stand strong with my own strength!

27:31.070 --> 27:32.700
Dance of 1,000 Butterflies!

27:36.550 --> 27:38.180
This is when the real game begins.

27:53.350 --> 27:54.940
He actually crushed the Celestial Ninefold Zither

27:55.270 --> 27:56.530
without using Hell Palm.

28:12.310 --> 28:13.380
I've lost.

28:16.160 --> 28:16.810
That's right.

28:18.510 --> 28:19.490
You've lost.

28:23.400 --> 28:24.290
Now,

28:27.310 --> 28:28.770
I finally understood

28:30.720 --> 28:33.380
what Master meant back then.

28:40.310 --> 28:40.940
Zizhe,

28:41.920 --> 28:43.220
why do you live?

28:45.720 --> 28:47.460
I live for the glory of the Mu family.

28:47.880 --> 28:50.180
I, Mu Zizhe, wish to make the Mu family prosper.

28:50.350 --> 28:52.250
I will make our family the leader among the Three Families.

28:54.400 --> 28:54.810
Excellent.

29:01.070 --> 29:01.770
Ciling,

29:02.160 --> 29:02.620
what about you?

29:07.510 --> 29:08.220
You're distracted again.

29:13.240 --> 29:13.770
Ciling,

29:14.480 --> 29:15.810
why do you live, then?

29:16.000 --> 29:17.660
Of course I live for my own sake.

29:19.510 --> 29:20.360
The Mu family

29:20.360 --> 29:22.490
is made up of members of the Mu family.

29:23.160 --> 29:24.490
If every member of the Mu family

29:24.590 --> 29:25.530
can truly live for

29:25.550 --> 29:26.460
their own sake

29:26.590 --> 29:28.220
and become strong,

29:28.720 --> 29:30.320
the Mu family will prosper naturally.

29:30.790 --> 29:31.290
By then,

29:31.720 --> 29:33.090
the Mu family could rule over the Three Families naturally.

29:34.200 --> 29:35.900
If I can become the strongest member of Blood River,

29:36.680 --> 29:37.490
naturally, the Mu family

29:37.920 --> 29:39.770
will become the strongest clan in Blood River.

30:17.780 --> 30:24.540
♪The wind still sighs, scattering fate's remains♪

30:24.620 --> 30:31.420
♪The slanting rain moistens a youthful chain♪

30:31.460 --> 30:35.220
♪In a fleeting glance, I gather frost and regret♪

30:35.260 --> 30:39.220
♪Upon the board, I wager my soul to chase the moon again...♪

30:41.070 --> 30:41.940
What a fool.

30:45.750 --> 30:47.770
He's helpless.

30:52.880 --> 30:54.090
Utterly helpless.

30:54.780 --> 31:01.020
♪The stubborn flame devours the calloused cocoon...♪

31:02.640 --> 31:04.660
The question that Master asked us back then

31:05.640 --> 31:07.290
had no meaning to it at all!

31:08.790 --> 31:09.860
If that's the case,

31:10.920 --> 31:12.140
several decades had passed since then.

31:13.110 --> 31:14.380
How would you know immediately

31:14.440 --> 31:15.380
which question Mu Zizhe was referring to

31:17.350 --> 31:18.180
right before

31:18.200 --> 31:18.860
his death?

31:20.460 --> 31:23.700
♪A fleeting breeze snuffs out the name I bore...♪

31:25.400 --> 31:26.490
It's because every word uttered

31:26.550 --> 31:27.530
by that old fool

31:27.590 --> 31:28.700
was meaningless.

31:30.310 --> 31:31.770
Blood River is meaningless.

31:33.590 --> 31:35.010
The Mu family is meaningless.

31:37.110 --> 31:38.860
Killing is meaningless.

31:41.830 --> 31:43.940
Only the existence of I, Mu Ciling,

31:46.030 --> 31:48.660
have my own meaning!

31:54.790 --> 31:55.810
I couldn't tell at all.

31:56.700 --> 31:58.230
To think that you were a philosopher.

32:00.480 --> 32:01.380
You...

32:03.680 --> 32:05.220
You idiot.

32:08.790 --> 32:09.380
Arrest them!

32:10.750 --> 32:12.520
They came here much quicker than we thought.

32:12.720 --> 32:13.930
Let's help Yu

32:13.930 --> 32:14.980
to stall them.

32:15.000 --> 32:15.420
Let's go.

32:17.350 --> 32:18.090
Why don't we head inside?

32:18.550 --> 32:19.860
We should wait for Changhe's signal.

32:21.310 --> 32:21.900
He said

32:22.310 --> 32:23.660
he would only summon us

32:23.880 --> 32:24.980
when it's absolutely necessary.

32:25.400 --> 32:26.010
They must be idiots.

32:26.680 --> 32:28.050
Why must they head inside and force a fight?

32:28.440 --> 32:29.180
With your 1,000-Spider Array

32:29.480 --> 32:30.940
and the mystical poison I invented,

32:32.590 --> 32:33.530
the Shadow Sect

32:33.830 --> 32:34.700
can be dealt with easily.

32:36.790 --> 32:37.940
Miss Bai, are you anxious?

32:41.270 --> 32:43.030
Aren't you anxious at all?

32:44.880 --> 32:45.420
Don't worry.

32:46.030 --> 32:47.490
The two brothers have never lost a fight

32:47.920 --> 32:48.810
that they fought together.

33:06.680 --> 33:09.220
Inside your sword lies an aura.

33:09.830 --> 33:10.770
I saw it before.

33:11.070 --> 33:12.770
It's Spring Rain Sword Aura.

33:13.350 --> 33:14.010
Kid,

33:14.480 --> 33:15.780
who exactly are you?

33:16.200 --> 33:17.770
I'm Su Muyu of Blood River.

33:18.270 --> 33:19.730
I'm also a vengeful spirit

33:20.110 --> 33:21.330
of No-Sword City.

33:22.720 --> 33:24.180
The lord of No-Sword City,

33:24.270 --> 33:25.050
Zhuo Yuluo,

33:25.440 --> 33:26.380
who is he to you?

33:27.200 --> 33:28.420
He's my father.

33:31.070 --> 33:31.980
Now that I'm looking at you,

33:33.790 --> 33:35.700
you do resemble him a lot.

33:36.510 --> 33:37.770
So, the lord of No-Sword City

33:37.920 --> 33:39.090
actually has a descendant, huh?

33:40.680 --> 33:42.180
And, his descendant actually became

33:42.180 --> 33:43.460
a Nameless of Blood River.

33:45.000 --> 33:46.290
This is interesting indeed.

33:46.830 --> 33:48.220
Now, I understand

33:48.480 --> 33:49.330
why you must visit

33:49.400 --> 33:50.810
the Wanjuan Tower behind me.

33:51.640 --> 33:53.250
It's because it contains

33:53.720 --> 33:55.180
the secret of your background.

33:55.830 --> 33:57.660
It also contains the secret

33:58.000 --> 33:59.660
behind No-Sword City's annihilation.

34:00.240 --> 34:00.700
That's right.

34:01.270 --> 34:02.570
Therefore, no one

34:02.590 --> 34:03.530
can stop me.

34:05.960 --> 34:07.050
If that's the case,

34:08.760 --> 34:11.090
we have no choice but to join hands.

34:21.550 --> 34:22.860
You guys are truly shameless.

34:23.550 --> 34:24.900
You three are trying to gang up on him.

34:25.360 --> 34:26.740
If so, let me join the fight.

34:27.510 --> 34:27.980
Changhe.

34:28.840 --> 34:29.460
You should leave for now.

34:30.150 --> 34:30.980
I know you're already exhausted.

34:31.590 --> 34:32.460
You don't need to fight

34:33.360 --> 34:34.420
as long as I'm still standing.

34:36.030 --> 34:37.340
Although we have the same surnames,

34:37.840 --> 34:39.130
they led a pampered life

34:39.190 --> 34:39.980
in Tianqi City.

34:40.800 --> 34:42.050
Generations had passed.

34:42.550 --> 34:43.490
They're no longer the shadow

34:43.550 --> 34:44.460
within the darkness.

34:45.070 --> 34:46.210
Now, they're nobles

34:46.280 --> 34:47.050
that live on the surface.

34:47.760 --> 34:48.820
They've long forgotten

34:49.360 --> 34:50.860
how to take one's life.

35:08.150 --> 35:09.820
I didn't expect

35:10.670 --> 35:12.210
to witness the true Eighteen-Sword Array again

35:12.280 --> 35:13.740
in this lifetime.

35:14.670 --> 35:16.300
Back then, there were only 17 swords.

35:16.920 --> 35:18.610
I never witnessed the 18th sword.

35:19.480 --> 35:20.420
When the 18th sword is used,

35:21.280 --> 35:22.260
winning or losing no longer matters.

35:22.920 --> 35:24.050
Only one's life is at stake.

35:24.400 --> 35:26.650
If so, let's see who the final victor is!

37:00.840 --> 37:02.380
You would've died

37:03.190 --> 37:04.460
had we not joined hands.

37:07.840 --> 37:08.530
You guys may leave.

37:10.630 --> 37:11.900
I no longer wish to be an assassin.

37:12.800 --> 37:13.780
The members of Blood River

37:14.280 --> 37:14.980
no longer wish to do so either.

37:15.880 --> 37:16.420
That's right.

37:17.960 --> 37:18.780
But I think

37:19.630 --> 37:20.690
you shouldn't leave anyone alive

37:22.110 --> 37:23.460
now that you've shown them the 18th sword.

37:26.280 --> 37:27.780
Although Changhe and I are Nameless,

37:29.030 --> 37:29.900
we have companions

37:29.920 --> 37:30.860
just like you all.

37:32.360 --> 37:33.530
They have the surnames Su,

37:34.510 --> 37:35.260
Xie, and Mu,

37:36.550 --> 37:37.460
which are the same as yours.

37:39.320 --> 37:41.530
Emotions never mattered in Blood River.

37:43.030 --> 37:44.800
However, I hope that they will be able to lead a life

37:46.510 --> 37:48.610
where they can walk in the sunlight.

37:53.320 --> 37:55.980
We were one from the start.

37:57.320 --> 37:59.940
The Shadow Sect ruled over Blood River and the Three Families.

38:00.480 --> 38:02.180
At the same time, they support our three families

38:02.400 --> 38:04.360
in Tianqi City.

38:05.920 --> 38:07.300
I don't dare to promise anything else.

38:08.190 --> 38:09.380
But there's one thing I can promise.

38:11.030 --> 38:11.820
From now on,

38:13.000 --> 38:13.940
the Shadow Sect shall cease to exist.

38:16.440 --> 38:17.570
Once you leave this place,

38:18.360 --> 38:20.410
no one is going to cause trouble for you all.

38:23.150 --> 38:24.870
There are certain things that have to be changed.

38:28.030 --> 38:29.940
We will reach the Other Shore eventually.

38:30.920 --> 38:31.780
There should not

38:32.190 --> 38:33.490
be endless night,

38:34.440 --> 38:35.610
but light.

38:39.670 --> 38:40.340
Excellent!

38:41.630 --> 38:43.740
You've thoroughly impressed me.

38:45.670 --> 38:46.090
Fusheng.

38:47.480 --> 38:47.980
That's enough.

38:49.960 --> 38:50.690
Yi Bu

38:51.000 --> 38:52.940
wasn't a leader worth our service.

38:53.710 --> 38:55.090
The three of us knew that

38:55.710 --> 38:56.610
long ago.

38:57.360 --> 38:58.740
Moreover, now,

38:59.440 --> 39:00.890
the Four Guardians of Tianqi,

39:00.920 --> 39:03.050
who serve the Prince of Langya,

39:03.190 --> 39:04.530
reign supreme in Tianqi City.

39:05.110 --> 39:05.900
The Shadow Sect

39:06.230 --> 39:07.940
has fallen from grace long ago.

39:08.880 --> 39:10.380
Instead of perishing together with him,

39:10.840 --> 39:11.490
we should

39:12.230 --> 39:13.490
seek another way out.

39:21.840 --> 39:22.900
If so, Mr. Su,

39:23.280 --> 39:24.570
let us part ways here.

39:25.230 --> 39:27.530
I hope you can realize your wish

39:27.880 --> 39:29.620
and bring forth a new Blood River.

39:30.230 --> 39:31.940
The current Blood River is already a brand new organization.

39:32.840 --> 39:34.460
It's just that its image in people's hearts

39:35.550 --> 39:36.780
hasn't changed yet.

39:48.100 --> 39:50.980
[Wanjuan Tower]

39:52.480 --> 39:53.380
I suppose Yu has succeeded.

39:53.800 --> 39:54.260
Miss Bai.

39:56.710 --> 39:58.260
I don't think anything else will happen here.

39:58.550 --> 39:59.450
You should head to the inn

39:59.480 --> 40:00.140
and meet up with the rest.

40:00.510 --> 40:01.260
What about you?

40:02.760 --> 40:03.690
Now that things have settled down,

40:04.550 --> 40:06.170
it's time for me to deal with my personal affairs.

40:06.230 --> 40:06.860
I won't be heading back.

40:07.800 --> 40:08.170
All right.

40:08.960 --> 40:09.740
Beauty Mu,

40:09.920 --> 40:10.690
please look after yourself.

40:11.960 --> 40:12.380
Farewell.

40:25.360 --> 40:25.940
Why did you do that?

40:26.510 --> 40:27.650
You wouldn't need to end up like this

40:27.880 --> 40:28.690
had we fought together just now.

40:34.590 --> 40:35.610
If we fought together just now,

40:36.710 --> 40:38.260
both parties would've fought until the end.

40:38.840 --> 40:39.530
It's been so long

40:39.550 --> 40:40.420
since you used the 18th sword.

40:41.070 --> 40:41.690
Logically speaking,

40:41.760 --> 40:43.240
once you cast the complete Eighteen-Sword Array,

40:43.400 --> 40:44.420
no one would've survived.

40:45.110 --> 40:46.870
But you actually spared those old fools.

40:47.710 --> 40:49.340
If I must say, you should've killed them.

40:49.800 --> 40:51.260
We have to start from scratch anyway.

40:51.590 --> 40:53.490
There are certain things we have to start from scratch,

40:54.360 --> 40:55.420
but not everything.

40:58.840 --> 40:59.780
For example, we have to

41:01.110 --> 41:02.260
reduce Wanjuan Tower to ashes.

41:06.440 --> 41:07.010
Changhe,

41:07.920 --> 41:09.090
the opponent we reserved for you is arriving.

41:09.480 --> 41:10.170
If it's against him,

41:10.590 --> 41:11.860
I can cast aside life and death, am I right?

41:12.710 --> 41:13.420
Suit yourself.

41:14.630 --> 41:15.300
All right.

41:17.920 --> 41:18.420
Wait.

41:19.840 --> 41:20.380
Su Muyu,

41:21.150 --> 41:21.940
why do I feel like

41:22.000 --> 41:22.980
you're the true Patriarch

41:23.110 --> 41:24.380
while I'm just an errand boy?

41:31.150 --> 41:32.740
I suppose I brought this upon myself.

41:34.500 --> 41:42.860
[Wanjuan Tower]

41:48.340 --> 41:52.900
[Wanjuan Tower]

41:55.860 --> 41:59.340
♪Like fate, winding with the tide♪

41:59.380 --> 42:03.260
♪Who can ford this river of night?♪

42:05.100 --> 42:08.580
♪Where's the far shore we chase all our lives?♪

42:08.620 --> 42:12.460
♪Surrendering all hues for a glimmer of light♪

42:14.460 --> 42:17.740
♪Through joy and sorrow♪

42:17.860 --> 42:19.940
♪Still I can't let go♪

42:20.100 --> 42:23.540
♪Longing keeps me awake at night♪

42:24.020 --> 42:26.220
♪My heart no longer my own♪

42:26.340 --> 42:31.340
♪No one can escape from love♪

42:47.940 --> 42:51.660
♪How many hidden feelings♪

42:51.780 --> 42:55.860
♪Sink in silence deep?♪

42:57.100 --> 43:00.980
♪Searching through the endless nights♪

43:01.100 --> 43:05.340
♪Struggling on the edge of love and pain♪

43:06.460 --> 43:09.340
♪Shadows crossing shadows♪

43:09.420 --> 43:13.660
♪Whose name hides in your eyes?♪

43:15.940 --> 43:19.940
♪When the wind blows, ask not when I shall return♪

43:19.980 --> 43:23.420
♪Ask not when I shall return♪

43:24.940 --> 43:28.380
♪Like fate, winding with the tide♪

43:28.460 --> 43:32.260
♪Who can ford this river of night?♪

43:34.180 --> 43:37.620
♪Where's the far shore we chase all our lives?♪

43:37.660 --> 43:41.500
♪Surrendering all hues for a glimmer of light♪

43:43.540 --> 43:46.780
♪Through joy and sorrow♪

43:46.900 --> 43:48.980
♪Still I can't let go♪

43:49.180 --> 43:52.580
♪Longing keeps me awake at night♪

43:53.060 --> 43:55.260
♪My heart no longer my own♪

43:55.340 --> 44:00.380
♪No one can escape from love♪

